<title>HONG KONG: BOC Group 1996 pre-tax profit up 21 pct - agency.</title>
<headline>BOC Group 1996 pre-tax profit up 21 pct - agency.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of China Group posted a pre-tax profit growth of 20.5 percent last year, Beijing-backed Hong Kong-based China News Agency reported on Thursday,</p>
<p>The growth rate was similar to that in 1995, the report quoted Yang Zilin, Bank of China Hong Kong branch general manager, as saying. But it gave no absolute profit figure.</p>
<p>He expected Hong Kong's gross domestic product to grow 5.5 percent this year, versus the 4.7 percent growth rate in 1996, the agency said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
